"effect upon publication. Continued use of the Service after publication "
"means the Partner agrees to the new Terms."

#: directory/templates/directory/legal_info.html:444
msgid "3.9. Заключительные положения"
msgstr "3.9. Final provisions"

#: directory/templates/directory/legal_info.html:445
msgid ""
